[{"title":"新雁","author":"武衍","text":"塞月程程远，星河字字疏。\n不眠沙外水，恐湿足间书。\n倦翮支风去，悲声落枕初。\n秋清人易感，政自不关渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30835,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡觉","author":"武衍","text":"睡觉东风忽惘然，起翻云母续炉烟。\n半醒不醉宿酲思，欲雨又晴寒食天。\n春草池塘诗梦里，梨花庭院酒尊前。\n谁怜倦客长安市，节物惊心忆旧年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30836,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"癖","author":"武衍","text":"剩欲收神省费心，三生痴癖本来深。\n典衣寻访晋朝画，折简借观雷氏琴。\n帖字逼真尝细拓，诗联敲稳每长吟。\n镜中一笑成何事，鬓影秋丝日见侵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30837,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘八窗见访一夕即别","author":"武衍","text":"五年苕上别，别后愧相疏。\n今夕知何夕，忆渠俄见渠。\n同持一杯酒，胜寄百封书。\n未及论心事，晓风回蹇驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30838,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伯氏自吴门来辇下再宿即别","author":"武衍","text":"把酒论新事，移床问故山。\n桑麻云已长，亲戚喜相安。\n断雁江湖外，驰心梦寐间。\n两年三度别，此别觉尤难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30839,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别燕","author":"武衍","text":"宝墨烟云邈，金风庭户秋。\n有雏堪作伴，无计若为留。\n谨勿沾鲸浪，应须避蜃楼。\n裁诗聊寄远，烦慰玉人愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30840,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤山访梅不遇简知己","author":"武衍","text":"结客寻春过旧堤，雪香云冷锁双扉。\n隔墙应是梅花笑，敝却貂裘尚未归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30841,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哀魏方泉 其二","author":"武衍","text":"诏下催归觐，人传便尹京。\n班才联从橐，庭忽舞铭旌。\n玉树悲中折，金丹圣莫生。\n泽多唯乳子，天道若无情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30842,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词补遗 其一","author":"武衍","text":"梨花风动玉阑香，春色沈沈锁建章。\n唯有落红官不禁，尽教飞舞出宫墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30843,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓京口四首答汤菊庄兼简分司郑料院 其一 北固亭口占","author":"武衍","text":"三生结得润人缘，卮酒时来暖客毡。\n北固儿童虽不识，也缘巾屦过山前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30844,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩干照夜白 其一","author":"武衍","text":"八尺?龙雪到蹄，阿瞒骑罢阿环骑。\n绝怜千古房星魄，不见明时见乱时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30845,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔家傲","author":"法常","text":"此事楞严常露布。\n梅华雪月交光处。\n一笑寥寥空万古。\n风瓯语。\n迥然银汉横天宇。\n蝶梦南华方栩栩。\n斑斑谁跨丰干虎。\n而今忘却来时路。\n江山暮。\n天涯目送鸿飞去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30846,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吟","author":"牧得清","text":"完得一局棋，除此一袭衣。\n何去何来兮，白云共依稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30847,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题义门胡氏华林书院","author":"牧湜","text":"门籍偏彰孝义名，书斋高启集群英。\n池光冷射缣缃帙，竹籁清含弦诵声。\n养鹤庭连栽药圃，驻僧居近煮茶铛。\n江上胜地文章盛，岁岁人看出谷莺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30848,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题毛巅岭","author":"竺大本","text":"凿破岩崖砥样平，要令民旅得通行。\n为君题作毛巅岭，留取毛巅千古名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30849,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题朱赏门","author":"绍兴卜者","text":"涧水涓涓绕洞崖，洞边时有小桃开。\n四边环合疑无路，为问东风何处来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30850,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题观音石壁","author":"绍兴卜者","text":"金紫玉青世所稀，牡丹花下探天机。\n仙游秀水真消息，身傍御炉香满衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30851,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"绍兴太学生","text":"万鸽飞翔绕帝都，朝昏收放费功夫。\n何如养取云边雁，沙漠能传二圣书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30852,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"绍兴某贵人","text":"绿树带云山罨画，斜阳入地竹销金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30853,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投秦丞相","author":"绍兴选人","text":"多少儒生新及第，高烧银烛照蛾眉。\n格天阁上三更雨，犹诵车攻复古诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30854,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"绍兴道者","text":"万里云归洞，千山水向东。\n玉炉香冷处，烟散碧霞中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30855,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"绍兴朝士","text":"疾风劲草识忠臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30856,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠阳大明","author":"绍兴道人","text":"阳君真确士，孝行动穹壤。\n皇上怜其艰，七夕遣回往。\n逡巡药顽石，遗子为馈享。\n子既不我受，吾亦不汝强。\n风埃难少留，愿子志勿爽。\n会当首鼠记，青云看反掌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30857,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请陶公五首 其五","author":"罗一龙","text":"平生心事辱相知，矻矻逢人说项斯。\n可恨襄阳失庞老，朔风吹泪送灵轜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30858,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请陶公五首 其四","author":"罗一龙","text":"剖竹公符墨未乾，先生雅意只青山。\n潇然纸帐梅花梦，不到清香画戟间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30859,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请陶公五首 其三","author":"罗一龙","text":"尽说休官靖节贤，几人真个隐林泉。\n如今却有云仍在，牢在平塘十五年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30860,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请陶公五首 其二","author":"罗一龙","text":"幕府当年誉四驰，诸公每恨识之迟。\n长材若肯为时用，世上何官不可为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30861,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请陶公五首 其一","author":"罗一龙","text":"古貌如公更古心，宦情终浅道情深。\n区区饱煖何曾计，一字廉称值万金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30862,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽知容州朝请陶公 其三","author":"罗一鹗","text":"昔曾亲诲色，霜凛更春温。\n貌古心犹古，年尊德亦尊。\n顿惊生死隔，奈有典型存。\n愁绝飞丹旐，凭谁为返魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30863,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽知容州朝请陶公 其二","author":"罗一鹗","text":"世亦多真士，当于晚节看。\n急流能勇退，袖手但旁观。\n凡卉随春尽，孤标耐岁寒。\n始终全所守，此事古来难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30864,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽知容州朝请陶公 其一","author":"罗一鹗","text":"月旦争推重，邦人得范模。\n官资虽刺史，气味一寒儒。\n简淡根真性，清廉律薄夫。\n不知书卓行，曾入史编无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30865,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"下第西归 其一","author":"罗与之","text":"抛却银袍制芰荷，春风一曲紫芝歌。\n古来至宝多横道，何事荆山泣卞和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30866,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"下第西归 其二","author":"罗与之","text":"才难济世甘避世，心不怨天唯乐天。\n林下山间深密处，曲肱饮水兴悠然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30867,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其四","author":"罗与之","text":"槁叶忘身绝涧流，芦花摇手欲风休。\n羡渠山鸟浑无事，相对飞鸣草树秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30868,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其二","author":"罗与之","text":"烟草凄迷露未晞，一筇伴我立晴晖。\n丹枫虽老犹多态，散作漫山野蝶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30869,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其五","author":"罗与之","text":"片云轻度半岩阴，巾屦俄惊翠霭深。\n涧底寒泉知客懒，石根㶁㶁自长吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30870,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其六","author":"罗与之","text":"乌藤落手野烟开，水秀山明入望来。\n旧日经行曾著语，试看石壁已莓苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30871,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其七","author":"罗与之","text":"尽日留连兴未阑，寒鸦背负夕阳还。\n遥知今夜空窗梦，只在江南水石间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30872,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其一","author":"罗与之","text":"狂飙卷雨辨朝曦，似与新晴有会期。\n秋水秋山秋草木，浑将乞与数篇诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30873,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行 其三","author":"罗与之","text":"旆旆黄茆泼眼明，荒郊尽日绝人行。\n谁知气象萧条处，剩有山川可鼎烹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30874,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居闲思 其二","author":"罗与之","text":"菡萏儿女态，舂锄金石交。\n晚来微雨过，凉思满蒲梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30875,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居闲思 其三","author":"罗与之","text":"雨作糟床注，秋生鲈鲙思。\n卷帘了清景，沉水袅烟丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30876,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居闲思 其一","author":"罗与之","text":"云散山月吐，星稀山月高。\n相羊风露底，望月诵离骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30877,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"才是","author":"罗与之","text":"忍看繁红委路尘，空馀野草绿无垠。\n人生忧乐何终极，才是迎春又送春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30878,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为言","author":"罗与之","text":"日薄寒浓春意微，花须柳眼尚依稀。\n为言羯鼓休频打，催得先开即早飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30879,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀花 其二","author":"罗与之","text":"汤沐晴空颢露繁，清香十里压旃檀。\n纱窗梦觉秋风度，疑是移家住广寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30880,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀花 其一","author":"罗与之","text":"金粟如来涧壑姿，不随桃李赴春期。\n江南花品秋居最，何况秋花中绝奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30881,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木犀花 其三","author":"罗与之","text":"秋影连蜷隐士攀，浑无蜂蝶涴林间。\n何人说与陶元亮，未必东篱胜小山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30882,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长至书意","author":"罗与之","text":"万草千花若死灰，阳和一气已潜回。\n莫言举世无先觉，几处寒梢放野梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30883,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花下叹","author":"罗与之","text":"人生何处较穷通，天意元难测始终。\n花落花开翻覆手，君看同此一春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30884,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿郁木福地尚羊明月间遐想仙风得五十六字 其一","author":"罗与之","text":"骑气乘云事已灰，娟娟野月照苍苔。\n自怜不及坛前石，曾遇仙翁蹑屐来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30885,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿郁木福地尚羊明月间遐想仙风得五十六字 其二","author":"罗与之","text":"凄凉风露湿人衣，犹自踟躇未忍归。\n树影忽来山月转，误惊鹤翅似轮飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30886,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看叶","author":"罗与之","text":"红紫飘零草不芳，始宜撰杖向池塘。\n看花应不如看叶，绿影扶疏意味长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30887,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倦倚","author":"罗与之","text":"蝉声燕语细相和，池面才浮点点荷。\n倦倚阑干消永日，葡萄阴薄柳风多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30888,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"展转","author":"罗与之","text":"邮亭彻夜听秋声，展转藜床直到明。\n月白霜轻寒剪剪，筑成万里客愁城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30889,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寂聊","author":"罗与之","text":"睡起和春倚小廊，寂聊情绪满斜阳。\n园林已是花飞急，帘幕争禁燕语忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30890,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄衣曲 其三","author":"罗与之","text":"此身倘长在，敢恨归无日。\n但愿郎防边，似妾缝衣密。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30891,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄衣曲 其二","author":"罗与之","text":"愁肠结欲断，边衣犹未成。\n寒窗剪刀落，疑是剑镮声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30892,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一夜","author":"罗与之","text":"潦收野水净，云阵布重阴。\n一夜西风急，千山落叶深。\n身犹衣暑服，耳已厌寒砧。\n对此无心者，还应雪满簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30893,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三高亭","author":"罗与之","text":"灼灼曾晖渐欲西，长桥弭棹倚栏时。\n湖光渺漭浮寒鉴，山色依稀抹黛眉。\n一舸功成非本志，三秋归思亦何迟。\n始终唯有天随子，笑却旌招理钓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30894,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己亥中秋","author":"罗与之","text":"此行不负中秋夜，采石江头醉及晨。\n独御凉风寻古迹，惊看明月照今人。\n诗骚寂寞虽云久，光景推移岂解陈。\n却怪悲鸣营度处，笔端何事竟无神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30895,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书感","author":"罗与之","text":"设险重门未足凭，民心应自有长城。\n朝廷休戚视田野，宗社存亡非甲兵。\n气实精神宁敝竭，本枯枝叶可敷荣。\n古人经理先观势，两臂于韩孰重轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30896,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰台闲眺台前瞰军垒有感而赋","author":"罗与之","text":"秋风携野客，杖屦凤凰台。\n忍见貔貅戍，更闻鸿雁来。\n时方忧大厦，世岂乏良才。\n何日览辉至，龙文载九垓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30897,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文到","author":"罗与之","text":"简编香外雨瓢翻，翰墨场中春日暄。\n文到工时疑有助，道逢极处本无言。\n当年谁可辈任昉，后世人方怪屈原。\n勿谓词章真小技，精粗徼妙岂殊根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30898,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"此悟","author":"罗与之","text":"遑遑偶偶亦堪悲，桀死尧生毕竟齐。\n空羡驼峰烹翠釜，漫思鲈脍拌金齑。\n荣华代谢看荆棘，今古推迁望涧溪。\n造化密移于此悟，长歌拾穗任天倪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30899,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行阻风小市","author":"罗与之","text":"弭棹黄芦外，江云绕柂牙。\n寒深身轸粟，风急浪生花。\n日暮人收市，年穷客念家。\n倚篷无可奈，忍见后归鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30900,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟次赤壁","author":"罗与之","text":"吴王岘畔泛川流，赤壁矶头半日游。\n胜地空馀豪杰迹，扁舟不载古今愁。\n极知风景终无异，莫念天时逝不留。\n伤事伤怀长太息，静看江面没浮沤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30901,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"却羡","author":"罗与之","text":"贵客宁知拂徵琴，郢人漫倚引商音。\n那堪岁月化双鬓，空有悲欢寄寸心。\n囊底有方餐白玉，床头无术致黄金。\n抗尘走俗曾何补，却羡鹪鹩托一林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30902,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"束担","author":"罗与之","text":"束担出荆扉，征尘染敝衣。\n人怜双鬓改，我悟半生非。\n抱璞今谁诉，知音古亦稀。\n寻思无一可，吾道欲安归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30903,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛舟秋怀","author":"罗与之","text":"白露消磨暑，丹枫点画秋。\n闲吟小山赋，归思大江流。\n世尽营三窟，人谁乐一丘。\n篷窗有佳致，月朗政风休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30904,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲立","author":"罗与之","text":"晚来闲立小溪边，看彻遥峰入紫烟。\n四壁尽堪供我隐，一寒未至乞人怜。\n功名不与樽前事，时序宁知局上迁。\n可笑区区当世士，满怀冰炭苦相煎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30905,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲居遣怀","author":"罗与之","text":"日暮掩松关，悠然谢往还。\n停杯因待月，徙倚为看山。\n贫悟道中乐，醉偷忙里闲。\n耳根偏可意，风涧响潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30906,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧疴","author":"罗与之","text":"六尘缘影政堪嗟，二竖乘虚势益加。\n忆昔鼻头能出火，即今眼底已生花。\n妇言伐性多因酒，医戒伤生少试茶。\n悟罢本来安得病，角弓谁使认为蛇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30907,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"始见","author":"罗与之","text":"雪后寒犹劲，书窗怯暂开。\n因沽江畔酒，姑见竹间梅。\n岁月峥嵘去，衰颓次第来。\n谁能忧许事，杖屦且徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30908,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林深","author":"罗与之","text":"林深氛杂不相关，众建芳馨两庑间。\n月榭琴弹新制曲，晓窗画展旧游山。\n凄凉风满竹十个，的皪春归梅一班。\n可笑野人无系累，机心犹在钓鱼湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30909,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]